Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航6: 未来之城》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.31,0:03:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,星历9521.6\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stardate 9521.6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,船长日志 上进号由苏路指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's log U.S.S. Excelsior. Hikaru Sulu commanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我首次完成叁年的船长任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After three years I've concluded my first assignment as master of this vessel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,记载第二区的气体反常现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cataloguing gaseous planetary anomalies in Beta Quadrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正全速返回基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading home under full impulse power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,太空船和船员一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pleased to report that ship and crew have functioned well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们己完成全区的调查工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to this,we've completed our survey of the entire sector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有强度240的能量流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an energy wave at 240 degrees mark six port.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visual!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My... God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快开防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields. Shields!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,太空船没有反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not answering her helm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,右边推进器 转入气流中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starboard thrusters. Turn her into the wave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,撞击力真大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to impulse power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,损毁报告 检查所有系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damage report. Checking all systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有流星雨吧 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was no meteor shower. Negative,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,子空间震动来自323.75方位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sub-space shock-wave originated at bearing 323.75.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,位置是普拉西斯 克林冈卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Location... It's Praxis,sir. It's a Klingon moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他们主要的能源产地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praxis is their key energy production facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,发讯给克林冈指挥部说我们是星盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send to Klingon High Command. "This is Excelsior,a Federation Starship."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,测出他们区内发生大爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We have monitored a large explosion in your sector."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,问他们是否需要援助 知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Do you require assistance?" Aye,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.87,0:05:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有其他资料吗？我确定了它的位置 但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Vultane,any more data? I've confirmed Praxis' location,but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,无法确定它的存在 放出来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot confirm Praxis' existence. On screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnify. Computer enhancement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是普拉西斯？对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praxis? What's left of it,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到普拉西斯的讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,I'm getting a message from Praxis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,接过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是卡拉 指挥部发言人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Brigadier Kerla, speaking for the High Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.37,0:06:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,普拉西斯的确有事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has been an incident on Praxis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但一切己恢复正常 不需援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,everything is under control. We have no need for assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,遵守条约规定 别进入中立区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obey treaty stipulations and remain outside the Neutral Zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This transmission ends now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有事发生？我们要报告此事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An incident? Do we report this,sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(舰队总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么要来？可能是退休派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we doing here? Maybe it's a retirement party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,真好 我刚买了小船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That suits me. I just bought a boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来要开学术会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm supposed to be chairing a seminar at the Academy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是高层人员会议吗 苏路呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this just for top brass? Where is Sulu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,苏路有任务在身 那 史波克 呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Sulu? On assignment. Where's Spock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这次议程要保密 有请总司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This briefing is classified. Ladies and gentlemen,the C-in-C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让我简述一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll break this information down succinctly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈帝国只剩下五十年寿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Klingon empire has 50 years of life left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,详细情况由星盟特使交代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For full details,I'm turning this briefing over to the Federation Special Envoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大家早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个月前测出普拉西斯发生爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two months ago a Federation Starship monitored an explosion on Praxis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可能因为采矿过度及安全设施不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe it was caused by over-mining and insufficient safety precautions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星爆炸导致臭氧层严重污染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moon's decimation means a deadly pollution of their ozone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的氧气在五十年内就会耗尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will have depleted their oxygen supply in 50 Earth years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,由於军事开支太大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Due to their enormous military budget{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈人没有经济能力应付这场灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Klingon economy doesn't have the resources to combat this catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,上月 应维冈总理要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last month,at the behest of the Vulcan Ambassador,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我与克林冈总理高冈对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I opened a dialogue with Gorkon, Chancellor of the Klingon High Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他建议马上展开谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He proposes to commence negotiations at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谈什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negotiations for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,解散中立区的太空站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dismantling of our space stations and bases along the Neutral Zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,结束七十年敌对状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An end to 70 years of hostility, which the Klingons can no longer afford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要星际舰队作後备？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill,are we talking about mothballing the Starfleet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不影响我们的科学探测计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our exploration and scientific programs would be unaffected,but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must protest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在星盟范围内庇护克林冈人等於自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To offer Klingons safe haven within Federation space is suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会变成银河系的外星垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingons would become the alien trash of the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果解散舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we dismantle the fleet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就无力对抗敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd be defenceless before an aggressive species on our territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要使他们屈服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The opportunity here is to bring them to their knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,才能发号施令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll be in a better position to dictate terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,长官却克船长？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir... Captain Kirk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈人从不可靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Klingons have never been trustworthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意卡上将的观点这个做法太恐布了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree with Admiral Cartwright. This is a terrifying idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当前急务是要支持高冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is imperative that we act now to support the Gorkon initiative,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,免得克林冈的保守势力…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lest more conservative elements persuade his empire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,煽动战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it's better to attempt a military solution and die fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,却克船长 你是首个和平大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You,Captain Kirk, are to be our first olive branch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要会合高冈的太空船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are to rendezvous with the vessel which is bringing Gorkon to Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,全程安全护送他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to escort him safely through Federation space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你和克林冈人对和约有同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are Klingons who feel the same about the peace treaty as yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有你指挥他们不会轻易攻击企业号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they'll think twice about attacking the Enterprise under your command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我私人担保你负责这项任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have personally vouched for you in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你私人担保？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have personally vouched?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你要以十足外交礼节款待高冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will extend Chancellor Gorkon full diplomatic courtesy,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我要有经验的大使 没有其他问题的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A full Ambassador is better equipped... If there's no further business...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我预祝你成功 散会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you and your crew Godspeed. Thank you,ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,紧记这个会议要保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remind you this meeting is classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知应否恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know whether to congratulate you or not,Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是自愿的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We volunteered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,维冈人有句俗语 尼克逊才可到中国去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an old Vulcan proverb. "Only Nixon could go to China."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎能担保我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you vouch for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我自作主张 我父亲要求我展开谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's arrogant presumption. My father requested that I open...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.34,0:11:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你父亲是维冈大使但你知道我的感受吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your father is the Vulcan Ambassador,but you know how I feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是野兽 却克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're animals. Jim...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是难得的机会 别相信他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an historic opportunity here. Don't believe them! Don't trust them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们快死了 让他们自生自灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're dying. Let them die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,舰队叁个月内就要解散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has it occurred to you that this crew is due to stand down in three months?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直为此而努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've done our bit for king and country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你该相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have trusted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,控制台 这是S D103接近太空码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control,this is S-D 103, approach to Space dock. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,接却克船长及队员到NCC1701\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are clear to deliver Captain Kirk and party to N.C.C. 1701 Alpha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,船长到了你是少校…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain on the bridge! As you were. Lieutenant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,韦利丽 我自荐做舵手的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Val'eris,sir. We were told you needed a helmsman,so I volunteered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴再见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is agreeable to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她是首个维冈人高材生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the first Vulcan to graduate at the top of her class at the Academy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很自豪 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be very proud. I don't believe so,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她是维冈人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a Vulcan,alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开始吧 离境站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this over with. Departure stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,史葛 找到引擎室吗？找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty? Did you find the engine room? Right where I left it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,准备 乌娜 替我接码头职员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by. Uhura,get me the dock master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,控制台读数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control tower reading,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.53,0:12:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,控制台 企业号申请离境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control,this is Enterprise requesting permission to depart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:13:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,申请获接纳 离闸门有叁十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Control. Permission to depart granted. 30 seconds for port gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,清除船索在此等候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear all moorings. Awaiting port gates from this mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,船索清除了後推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All lines clear. Aft thrusters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 要1/4动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,Lieutenant. 1 quarter impulse power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 推进器只限在码头上用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,regulations specify thrusters only while in space dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,却克…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,按指示做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the order,Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,船长日志 星历98522.6\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's log. Stardate 9522.6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不信任克林冈人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never trusted Klingons, and I never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们害死我儿子 不能原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can never forgive them for the death of my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,护送克林冈总理到和平高峰会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To escort the Chancellor of the Klingon High Council to a peace summit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真是棘手的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is problematic,at best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,史波克 说这是历史性时刻希望他对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock says this could be an historic occasion. I'd like to believe him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但我怎能担当这历史重任？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how on Earth can history get past people like me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起你该敲门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. You could have knocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快到会合处了 我特来报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are almost at the rendezvous,sir. I thought that you would like to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我很荣幸能为你效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to speak freely,sir. It is an honour to serve with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你的太空驾驶技术不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You piloted well out of space dock, Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的志愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wanted to try that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done well,Val'eris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你的工作表现很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As your sponsor at the Academy I've followed your career with satisfaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你比我预期中还出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as a Vulcan, you have exceeded my expectations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这幅画代表什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not understand this representation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是古时地球传说的描绘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a depiction from ancient Earth mythology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,被逐出天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The expulsion from Paradise."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要挂在房里？提醒自己一切也会完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why keep it in your quarters? To remind me that all things end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想说出这个结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is of endings that I wish to speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我视你为我们族中的智者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir,I address you as a kindred intellect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你察觉到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not recognise...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,星盟出现转捩点吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a turning point has been reached in the affairs of the Federation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,历史充满转捩点 怀着信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}History is replete with turning points. You must have faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,信心？宇宙正在发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faith? The universe will unfold as it should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,合逻辑吗？我们肯定… 合逻辑…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that logical? Surely we must... Logic,logic,logic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,逻辑是智慧之始 不是终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logic is the beginning of wisdom, Val'eris. Not the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我最後一次乘太空船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be my final voyage on board this vessel as a member of her crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,位置不能空着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nature abhors a vacuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想由你继任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend you to replace me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我会好好接替你的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could only succeed you,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人员请到驾驶台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now hear this. All officers to the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.17,0:17:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈巡航机离开了码头所有人员请到驾驶台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingon battle cruiser off the port bow. All Officers to the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,船长到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain on the bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要开防护罩吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we raise our shields,Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,从未如此接近过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been this close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,总理在等候指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chancellor is undoubtedly awaiting our signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,乌娜 打信号招呼 知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura,hailing frequencies. Aye,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,用右舵靠过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right standard rudder. Bring us alongside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,右舵z加5度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right standard rudder. Z plus 5 degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,接通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Channel is open,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是企业号太空船由却克船长指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Starship Enterprise. Captain James T. Kirk commanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是卡龙诺斯一号我是高冈总理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Kronos One. I am Chancellor Gorkon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们奉命护送你到地球开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been ordered to escort you to your meeting on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想来企业号进晚餐吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you and your party care to dine this evening aboard the Enterprise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来星盟作客好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as guests of the United Federation of Planets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们乐意接受邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We would be delighted to accept your gracious invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们七点半安排你们上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make arrangements to have you beamed aboard at 19:30 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我热切期待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall look forward to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.39,0:19:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你满意了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you're happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 我们有麦芽酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain! There is a supply of Romulan ale aboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.59,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有助聚会顺利进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might make the evening pass more... smoothly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer thinking,Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜谁会来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess who's coming to dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,通电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Energize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,高冈总理切克船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor Gorkon. Captain Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 史波克 你见过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I present Captain Spock, whom I believe you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终於见面了 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,face to face at last. You have my thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,总理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.10,0:20:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的女儿阿惜宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my daughter,Azetbur...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的军事顾问卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My military advisor,Brigadier Kerla...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是总参谋长张上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this is General Chang, my chief of staff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,久仰大名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have so wanted to meet you,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,过奖了 他真的很仰慕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure how to take that. Sincere admiration,Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,战士之间的感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From one warrior to another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,请来这边参观一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way. You might enjoy a brief tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的长相全都差不多 还有那股气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all look alike. What about that smell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只有首领才能说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know only top of the line models can even talk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有工作做吗？有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You men have work? Yes,ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快去办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then snap to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.95,0:22:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,齐来乾杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offer a toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.62,0:22:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为尚未发现的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The undiscovered country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,为未来为尚未发现的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future. The undiscovered country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哈姆雷特第叁幕第一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hamlet,act 3,scene 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看过克林冈文的莎士比亚才知道个中乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have not experienced Shakespeare until you've read him in Klingon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.04,0:23:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,麦芽酒不是非法的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk. I thought Romulan ale was illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,离星盟总部还有一千光年没有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An advantage of being 1,000 light years from Federation headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,敬高冈总理一杯他是我们未来的栋梁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To you,Chancellor Gorkon. One of the architects of our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,为总理乾杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.49,0:23:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可能我们现在己看到未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps we are looking at something of that future here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.93,0:23:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,却克 你愿放弃星际舰队吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me,Captain Kirk. Would you be willing to give up Starfleet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,船长认为舰队做的是和平任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Captain feels that Starfleet's mission has always been one of peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.62,0:23:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有异议 舰队一向…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't dispute my first officer. Starfleet has always been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.09,0:23:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不用转弯抹角太空所有战士也很冷酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need to mince words. In space,all warriors are cold warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢莎士比亚吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General, are you fond of... Shakespeare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.37,0:24:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为所有星球也该争取不可剥夺的人权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe all planets have a sovereign claim to inalienable human rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不可剥夺 你们只听取己见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Inalien..." If you could only hear yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,人权一词有种族歧视之意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Human rights." Why,the very name is racist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.29,0:24:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,星盟不再是智人的专利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Federation is a "homo sapiens only" club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,现时的同伴除外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Present company excepted,of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.33,0:24:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的文化会因此毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know where this is leading the annihilation of our culture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.07,0:24:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不对…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,做与不做是困扰我们的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To be or not to be"...That is the question which preoccupies our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要呼吸空间 地球 希特拉 1938年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need breathing room. Earth. Hitler,1938.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.05,0:24:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.82,0:24:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.33,0:25:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要走的路还漫长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see we have a long way to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.56,0:25:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎下次再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must do this again sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.84,0:25:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信我？我不怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't trust me,do you? I don't blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.74,0:25:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有新的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is to be a brave new world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.65,0:25:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的生活会十分艰难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our generation is going to have the hardest time living in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,洗 总理 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Spock. Chancellor. Madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.06,0:25:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢款待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,most kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.03,0:25:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,分离真是甜蜜的悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parting is such sweet sorrow. Hmm,Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.34,0:25:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听到午夜的报时钟吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Have we not heard the chimes at midnight?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.00,0:26:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看到他们的食相吗？全无餐桌礼仪可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see the way they ate? Terrible table manners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.71,0:26:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在外交史上一定很出众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt our own behaviour will distinguish us in the annals of diplomacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要睡了 今晚真是一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to sleep this off. Is there any other way we can screw up tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.92,0:26:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要喝咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to go find a pot of black coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.47,0:26:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,高冈总理昨晚到企业号进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise hosted Chancellor Gorkon to dinner last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.11,0:27:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的态度不太合礼节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our manners weren't exactly Emily Post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.88,0:27:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,通知厨房:以後的外交场合不得端上麦芽酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the galley Romulan ale no longer to be served at diplomatic functions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.89,0:27:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,却克 请到驾驶台找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk,will you please join me on the bridge? Captain Kirk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,船长有什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.57,0:27:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我感到奇怪我很累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find this curious. Spock,I'm really tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.60,0:27:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们录得大量中子辐射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are reading an enormous amount of neutron radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.68,0:27:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？好像由我们发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where? It appears to emanate from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.01,0:27:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.95,0:27:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,韦利丽 你知道辐射激增吗？查哥夫 你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Val'eris,do you know anything about a radiation surge? Chekov?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.92,0:27:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我的头那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the size of my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.83,0:27:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事？我们射中了总理的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happened? We've fired on the Chancellor's ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.81,0:28:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,发射室 我们有否发炮？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Torpedo room! Please confirm,have we fired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.59,0:28:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,乌娜 监测一下 知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura,monitor. Aye,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.95,0:28:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,直接击中证实了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Direct hit. Confirmed,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去引力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.12,0:28:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被出卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.29,0:28:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是驾驶台 收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the bridge. Do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.46,0:28:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有否发炮？没有 炸弹没消耗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we fire those torpedoes? Negative. We're still fully loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.68,0:29:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,找张上将
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.89,0:29:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,无法确定有否发炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unable to confirm or deny firing the torpedoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.23,0:29:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,打信号招呼 知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hailing frequencies. Aye,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,卡龙诺斯一号这是企业号 收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kronos One,this is Enterprise. Do you read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.53,0:30:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,情况混乱 有枪声和尖叫声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very hard to make out. There's been weapons firing and a lot of shouting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.21,0:30:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,船倾斜了 它失控地转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's still listing. She's spinning out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复後备引力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你一点气量也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you not a shred of decency in you,Kirk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.75,0:31:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你违背了我们的和约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We come in peace, and you blatantly defy that peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.42,0:31:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你在宇宙中消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For that, I shall blow you out of the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.16,0:31:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有发炮 船长…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't fired. Captain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,资料库显示我们发了两炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to our data banks, we have. Twice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.03,0:31:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,they're coming about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.78,0:32:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备开火要开防护罩吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're preparing to fire. Shields up,Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.81,0:32:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,防护罩要开骂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,our shields. Shields up,Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.55,0:32:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,发投降信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signal our surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.25,0:32:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We surrender!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.96,0:32:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号宣布投降 若他们发炮 我们没防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Enterprise. We surrender. If they fire,with our shields down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.70,0:32:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们毫无还击之力 重复 企业号投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will not be able to respond. Repeat,Enterprise surrenders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.50,0:32:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有发炮吗？我也想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we firing torpedoes? I wish I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.51,0:32:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要上船 你在此控制 我该负责 让我去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going aboard. Spock,take the con. I involved you,I will go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我去 总不能在和谈前夕开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I'll go. We'll not be the instigators of war on the eve of universal peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.48,0:32:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去 他们需要医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going too,they may need a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.55,0:32:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,乌娜 通知他们我们要上船 没有带武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura,tell them we're coming, and tell them we're unarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.33,0:32:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？我也不知发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you lost your mind? ! I don't understand what's happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.97,0:32:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.37,0:33:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.16,0:33:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,高冈总理 天 发生什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor Gorkon. My God! What has happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.10,0:33:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你还装作无知？他怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare to feign ignorance? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.84,0:33:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,被直接击中你破坏我们的引力系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a direct torpedo hit, you crippled our gravitational field{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.58,0:33:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们派来的凶手穿了磁靴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and two of your Starfleet crew beamed aboard wearing magnetic boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.78,0:33:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有医生吗？我们差不多全军覆没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you carrying a surgeon? We were until this disgrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.29,0:33:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,让我为他急救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then for God's sake,let me help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.20,0:34:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他还有脉搏 来 搬他到桌上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a pulse we can move him. I need light. Put him on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.11,0:34:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,捉紧他 我要稳定他的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold him! Hold him while I stabilize him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.19,0:34:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,捉紧他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said hold him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.10,0:34:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.83,0:34:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你行吗？我不清楚他的构造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you... I don't even know his anatomy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.57,0:34:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他的伤口不愈合 他想杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His wounds are not closing. He's killing him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.82,0:34:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他的身体机能停滞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone into some kind of damned arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.99,0:35:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,dammit! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.50,0:35:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not responding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.42,0:35:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不要就此结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let it end this way,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.32,0:36:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,根据星际法例第184条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under article 184 of your Interstellar Law...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.63,0:36:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拘捕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm placing you under arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.20,0:36:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你被控暗杀我们的总理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're charged with assassinating the Chancellor of the High Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.91,0:36:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他在抢救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.55,0:36:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.92,0:36:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,史波克 我们要想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Spock,we've got to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.02,0:36:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,太空船自二点半开始由我指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume command of this ship as of 02:30 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.42,0:36:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,乌娜 通知总部 寻求对策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Uhura,notify Starfleet headquarters and request instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.93,0:36:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能让他们进克林冈监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot allow them to be taken to Kronos as prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.47,0:36:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,开火无补於事 我们不能交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opening fire will not retrieve them, and we must avoid an armed conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.11,0:36:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可追查船长的行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will be able to follow the Captain's movements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.71,0:37:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样追查？时间很宝贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you achieve this? Time is precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.11,0:37:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要弄清今晚发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must piece together what happened here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.65,0:37:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,资料库显示我们发了两次炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to our data bank, this ship fired those torpedoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.45,0:37:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有可能 我同意 但我们需要证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way! I sympathize,but we need evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.33,0:37:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please accompany me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.50,0:37:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果查不出问题所在呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we cannot piece together what happened? What then,sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那就要由外交官处理了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case,Mr Chekov,it resides in the purview of the diplomats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,总理死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chancellor of the High Council is dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.71,0:37:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他受到突击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The result of an unprovoked attack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.61,0:37:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,当时他在执行和平任务途中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while he travelled to see you under a flag of truce on a mission of peace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.89,0:37:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,却克船长依法被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk was legally arrested for the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.39,0:37:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他和麦盖医生登上了卡龙诺斯一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He and Dr. McCoy boarded Kronos One of their own free will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.69,0:37:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不争的事实 我己下令调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of these facts are in dispute. I have ordered an investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.87,0:37:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,同时… 同时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the meantime... In the meantime...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.27,0:38:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望星盟遵守星际法例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we expect the Federation to abide by the articles of Interstellar Law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.98,0:38:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,却克和麦盖要为暗杀总理受审\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk and Dr. McCoy will stand trial for the assassination of Chancellor Gorkon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.12,0:38:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然 沙力 我们可引渡他们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the question. Ambassador Sarek,can we get them extradited?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.99,0:38:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我对此事有一定责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr President,I share a measure of personal responsibility in this matter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.59,0:38:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但我得确认他们的法律解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I am obliged to confirm my esteemed colleagues legal interpretation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.70,0:38:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,罗武伦政府持什么立场？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the position of the Romulan government?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意他们的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must concur with my colleagues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.67,0:38:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你相信却克会暗杀总理？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't believe that Kirk assassinated the Chancellor of the High Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.38,0:38:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,主席 我不知应该信什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr President. I don't know what to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.68,0:38:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我在等你答覆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm waiting for your answer,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.25,0:38:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能凌驾於法律之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This President is not above the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.57,0:38:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号 请回应 收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise, please reply. Received?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.41,0:39:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要马上回应 我们不能离弃船长他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're to report back at once. We can't abandon Kirk and McCoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.18,0:39:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,四百年前工人觉得机器有威胁性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}400 years ago,on Earth,workers who felt their livelihood threatened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.85,0:39:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,把凉鞋掉进机器弄停它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}flung their wooden shoes called "sabots" into the machines to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.56,0:39:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是英文捣乱一词的由来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence the word "sabotage".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.83,0:39:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们的後备系统坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We experience technical malfunction. All back-up systems inoperative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.24,0:39:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 不 真糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. I mean... too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.91,0:39:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我继任了父亲总理一职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr President,I have been named chancellor in my father's place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.15,0:39:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,总理小姐 请接受我的吊慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam Chancellor, you have my condolences on your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.55,0:39:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证那恶行不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you that this shameful deed will not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.76,0:39:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,既然大家都想继续和谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us come to the point. You want this conference to go forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.23,0:39:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我会在一周内出席 条件是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will attend in one week, on one condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.80,0:40:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会引渡囚犯你不用营救他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will not extradite the prisoners, and you will not attempt to rescue them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.47,0:40:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,否则等於煽动战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We would consider any such attempt an act of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.74,0:40:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望你来地球作客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hope you'll be our guest here on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.04,0:40:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,经此一役 我决定保持中立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After recent events,you will understand if I prefer a neutral site.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.28,0:40:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为了安全 会面地点要保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in the interests of security,let us keep the location secret for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.22,0:40:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你作主吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish,Madam Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.99,0:40:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,趁我们有能力 快攻击他们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.53,0:40:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,否则会成为他们的奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.91,0:40:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,动武可以占领全球
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.51,0:40:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,战争不合时宜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.35,0:40:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们身处险境
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.79,0:40:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我宁死也不委曲求全
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.69,0:41:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我父亲的遗愿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.43,0:41:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲是自愿给杀死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father was killed for what he wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.77,0:41:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,和谈要继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peace process will go forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.57,0:41:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,却克…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.84,0:41:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,却克要为我父亲偿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk will pay for my father's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.93,0:41:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,却克…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.86,0:41:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不知所谓的审讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a damn show trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号突击卡龙诺斯一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise fired on Kronos One without provocation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.81,0:42:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,总理及顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chancellor and his advisors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.85,0:42:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当晚七点半获邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}having been lulled into a false sense of security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.75,0:42:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,到企业号用膳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by an invitation to a dinner aboard Captain Kirk's vessel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.52,0:42:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因此放松了警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at precisely 19:30 hours that same evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.86,0:42:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,传第一证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call your first witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.56,0:42:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,第一击後 我们失去了引力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the first shot we lost our gravitational field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.26,0:42:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我失控地飘起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was weightless and couldn't function.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.73,0:42:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,两名星际舰队队员走过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then two Starfleet crewmen came towards me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.87,0:42:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他们乔装成队员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or perhaps they merely wore Starfleet uniforms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.71,0:42:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是猜测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That remark is speculative. I move that it be stricken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.04,0:42:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想听事实而非理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're interested in facts,not theories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.68,0:42:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有引力 他们如何行走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the gravitational unit was not functioning,how could they walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.19,0:42:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们穿了磁靴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They appeared to be wearing magnetic boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.16,0:43:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,引力靴？麦盖医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gravity boots? Dr. McCoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.96,0:43:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可否告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you be so good as to tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.97,0:43:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你目前的健康状况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what is your current medical status?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.17,0:43:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,除了动脉炎外 一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aside from a touch of arthritis, I'd say pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.75,0:43:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你真有幽默感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a singular wit,Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.42,0:43:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我为企业号服务了二十七年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For 27 years I've been surgeon aboard the U.S.S. Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.19,0:43:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还有叁个月就退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In three months I stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.53,0:43:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.56,0:43:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你当晚与众人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that you consumed rather a generous amount of Romulan ale{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.83,0:43:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喝了很多麦芽酒 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the officers mess on the night in question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.44,0:43:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,反对反对有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Objection. Sustained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.67,0:43:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们全都喝了 这不表示…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all did. All of us. That doesn't mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.41,0:43:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你诊断高冈总理时他还生存吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was Chancellor Gorkon alive when you first examined him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.28,0:43:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他己奄奄一息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.82,0:44:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前试过救活…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now be careful,Doctor. Have you ever in your past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.82,0:44:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,与他一样垂危的病人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saved patients as barely alive as he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.26,0:44:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不熟识克林冈人的构造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have the medical knowledge I needed for Klingon anatomy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.60,0:44:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？你也在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. You where there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.07,0:44:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你快退休了 会手震吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say you are due for retirement. May I ask,do your hands shake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.54,0:44:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,反对 我很紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Objection! I was nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.71,0:44:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是你无能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You were incompetent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.58,0:44:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你无能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were incompetent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.08,0:44:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,蓄意谋杀还是年老加酒精影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether deliberately or as a result of age combined with drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.45,0:44:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,法庭会判决 天 我在救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The court will have to determine. My God,man. I tried to save him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.46,0:44:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我尝试救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.30,0:44:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was desperate to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.20,0:44:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他是实现宇宙和平的最後希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the last best hope in the Universe for peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.87,0:44:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,证人可以退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The witness is excused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.95,0:45:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们己知道案情细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we have it,citizens. We have established the particulars of the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.92,0:45:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,现在要审讯这宗悲剧的主谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we come to the architect of this tragic affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.82,0:45:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,却克船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Tiberius Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.13,0:45:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你最喜爱的作家会说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would your favourite author say, Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.93,0:45:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下诉说己故国王的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Let us sit upon the ground and tell sad stories of the death of kings."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.57,0:45:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,说出你的故事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us your sad story,Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.08,0:45:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,说出你想怎样为子报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us that you planned to take revenge for the death of your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.35,0:45:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true. Objection!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.62,0:45:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没有证据显示却克船长是刺客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk has not been identified as the assassin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.69,0:45:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,请听听船长这番话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offer into the record this excerpt from the Captain's personal log.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.50,0:45:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不信任克林冈人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never trusted Klingons, and I never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.07,0:45:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们害死我儿子 不能原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been able to forgive them for the death of my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.04,0:46:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,再放一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.98,0:46:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不信任克林冈人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never trusted Klingons, and I never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.11,0:46:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们害死我儿子 不能原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been able to forgive them for the death of my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.36,0:46:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those your words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.69,0:46:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是我说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those words were spoken by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.10,0:46:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,反对 政治立场与本案无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Objection! My client's political views are not on trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.47,0:46:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他的政治立场正是关键问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the contrary. Captain Kirk's views are at the very heart of the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.51,0:46:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,记录显示他是个不守纪律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His record shows him to be an insubordinate,unprincipled opportunist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.95,0:46:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,经常违抗命令的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a history of violating the chain of command whenever it suited him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.49,0:46:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,继绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.02,0:46:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,却克船长曾任上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The record shows that Captain Kirk once held the rank of Admiral{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.56,0:47:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因胡作非为被降职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he was broken for taking matters into his own hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.67,0:47:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你敢否认吗？回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you deny being demoted for these charges. Answer me now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.70,0:47:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能否认 你被降职？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot deny it. You were demoted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.54,0:47:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因违抗命令？我有时不守纪律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For insubordination? On occasion,I have disobeyed orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.94,0:47:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你策划暗杀高冈总理时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you obeying or disobeying orders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.11,0:47:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是奉命行事还是违抗命令？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you arranged the assassination of Chancellor Gorkon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.18,0:47:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我上了船才知道他遇袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know about it until we boarded the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.09,0:47:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你仍然否认企业号向卡龙诺斯一号开火？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still deny the Enterprise fired on Kronos One?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.06,0:47:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你仍否认派人上船射杀总理？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you still deny your men beamed aboard and shot the Chancellor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.50,0:47:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能承认或否认不知情的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot confirm or deny actions which I didn't witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.37,0:47:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你身为太空船船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you aware that as the captain of a ship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.70,0:47:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要为下属的行为负贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are responsible for the actions of your men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.41,0:47:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.88,0:47:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,若你的下属证实策划暗杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's proved that members of your crew carried out the assassination...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.45,0:47:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在诬陷你 别回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're setting us up. Your Honours! Do not answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.56,0:48:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,却克船长必须回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk, you will answer the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.33,0:48:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,身为船长…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Captain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.77,0:48:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须为下属的行为负贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm responsible for the crew under my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.74,0:48:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,群情平静了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Honours,the state rests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.48,0:48:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,发讯给企业号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send to Commander Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.05,0:48:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上进号船长苏路愿意相助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We stand ready to assist you. Captain Sulu,U.S.S. Excelsior."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.72,0:48:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,法庭裁定被告罪名成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the determination of this court that the prisoners are guilty as charged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.28,0:48:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,本案证据并不充分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to note for the record that all the evidence is circumstantial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.01,0:49:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,恳请法庭判刑前考虑清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg the court to consider this when pronouncing its sentence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.95,0:49:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So noted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.69,0:49:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保持和谈的友好气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain James T. Kirk, Dr. Leonard McCoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.92,0:49:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,却克船长和麦盖医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the interest of fostering amity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.16,0:49:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,法庭决定判你们死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the forthcoming peace talks, the sentence of death is commuted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.51,0:49:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是法庭的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the judgement of this court{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.45,0:49:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有缓刑 不能假释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that,without possibility of reprieve or parole,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.32,0:49:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要被放逐到劳改星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you be taken from this place to the dilithium mines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.42,0:49:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁拉宾迪的矿场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the penal asteroid of Rura Penthe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.93,0:49:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里度过残生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There to spend the rest of your natural lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.11,0:49:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁拉宾迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rura Penthe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.51,0:50:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,银河系中的外星人坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Known throughout the galaxy as the alien's graveyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.02,0:50:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他更好 一了百了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better to kill them now and get it over with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.07,0:50:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请重播发炮镜头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant. The torpedo hit once again,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.85,0:50:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.52,0:50:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是企业号 是我们发炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Enterprise. We fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.76,0:50:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 全部炮弹还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not possible! All weapons visually accounted for,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.70,0:50:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我的祖先说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ancestor of mine maintained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.60,0:51:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,减去不可能 剩下的就是真理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that if you eliminate the impossible, whatever remains must be the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.67,0:51:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.04,0:51:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有发炮 但其他人有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That if we cannot have fired those torpedoes,someone else did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.38,0:51:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会向自己开火当时又无其他船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't fire on themselves and there are no other ships present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.52,0:51:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,中子曾经激增不是我们发出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a neutron surge. Not from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.49,0:51:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,促由另一艘船发出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A neutron surge that big could only be produced by another ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.59,0:51:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,卡龙诺斯一号？太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kronos One? Too far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.03,0:51:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很接近我们 可能在我们下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very near us. Possibly beneath us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.60,0:51:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果下面有船 他们定会看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there were a ship beneath us, the Klingons would have seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.17,0:51:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,会吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.78,0:51:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽号？猛禽号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Bird of Prey? A Bird of Prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.29,0:51:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,隐了形？隐形怎能开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cloaked? They can't fire when they're cloaked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,正常情况下是不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All things being equal,I would agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.43,0:52:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但此事很不寻常 或许有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,things are not equal. This one can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.30,0:52:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要通知司令 通知什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must inform Starfleet Command. Of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.40,0:52:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有新隐形武器？他们一定说我们疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new weapon that's invisible? They'll call us raving lunatics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.27,0:52:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说我们为了救船长什么也敢说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll say we'll say anything to exonerate the Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.21,0:52:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说得对 我们没有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they would be correct. We have no evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.62,0:52:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,只有切合现实的理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a theory which happens to fit the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.02,0:52:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为何要杀自己的总理？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assuming you're right. Why would they fire on their own President?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.09,0:52:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.16,0:52:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要彻底搜索这艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship will be searched from bow to stern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.46,0:52:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白 如果有船在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not understand. If there was a ship underneath us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.83,0:52:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,炮弹不会从这里发出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surely the assassins beamed aboard from that vessel,not Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.31,0:52:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're forgetting something, Mr Chekov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.81,0:52:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,资料库显示我们发了炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to our data banks, this ship fired those torpedoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.05,0:52:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手应该在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we did,the killers are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.42,0:52:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,改动资料库的人也在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we did not, whoever altered the data banks is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.09,0:53:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在此搜寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In either case, what we are looking for is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.89,0:53:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,搜寻什么？你认为呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we looking for,sir? Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.03,0:53:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,两双引力靴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two pairs of gravity boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.00,0:54:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是劳改星球鲁拉宾迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the gulag Rura Penthe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.73,0:54:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没有监狱  守卫塔  电子边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no stockades,no guard tower,no electronic frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.94,0:54:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只有磁力罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a magnetic shield prevents beaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.81,0:54:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,若有犯错 刑罚是逐上地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punishment means exile from prison to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.98,0:54:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能在地面生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the surface,nothing can survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.56,0:54:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,做好点 待遇会好点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work well,and you will be treated well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.20,0:54:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,做得不好 就会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work badly,and you will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.65,0:56:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.33,0:56:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有翻译员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The universal translator has been confiscated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.63,0:56:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.84,0:56:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他有话想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's definitely on about something,Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.68,0:56:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是你的范围 我们会走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is your spot,we'll move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.82,0:56:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他要你服从外星人公会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants your obedience to the Brotherhood of Aliens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.82,0:56:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题交出你的外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got it. And your coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.26,0:56:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕不称身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid not. It wouldn't fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.87,0:57:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 这有助你保暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. This will help keep you warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.41,0:57:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是马蒂亚 我知你们是谁 你怎知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Martia. You're Kirk and McCoy. How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.62,0:57:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们暗杀总理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't get many presidential assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.12,0:57:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有杀高冈 当然没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't kill Gorkon. Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.06,0:57:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但判你死刑有奖赏 有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's a reward for your death. That figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.13,0:57:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被诬陷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been set up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.16,0:57:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有人不想你们碍事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody up there wants you out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.94,0:57:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有何进展？没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any progress? None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.71,0:57:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有叁百人展开搜索但凶手也可能在其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A crew of 300 are looking everywhere,but the killers may still be among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.18,0:57:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,磁靴肯定己丢掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely they have disposed of these boots by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.82,0:58:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,靴子会否留在高冈的船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would it not have been logical to leave them on Gorkon's ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.92,0:58:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们离开时引力还未恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logic must give way to physics. Gravity wasn't restored when they escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.29,0:58:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没有磁靴就会浮起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without the boots,they would have floated off the transporter pads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.90,0:58:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,何不直接把它化掉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not simply vaporize them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.37,0:58:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.68,0:58:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不能未经许可在船上开死光枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know,no one can fire an unauthorized phaser aboard a starship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.45,0:58:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他们回来时扔掉靴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suppose,when they returned,they threw the boots into the refuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.79,0:58:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我正搜寻垃圾堆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having the refuse searched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.56,0:58:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜凶手把靴挂在颈上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm correct,those boots will cling to the killer's necks like Tiberian bats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.80,0:58:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能不穿靴离去也不能抛出窗外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They couldn't escape without them nor throw them out the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.91,0:58:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,靴子一定在这里某处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those boots are here. Somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.04,0:59:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有人开枪吗？没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did someone fire off a phaser? It's alright. It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.61,0:59:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队催促我们回码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Spock,Starfleet is screaming for us to return to port.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.19,0:59:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谁发射…史葛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who fired the... Ah,Mr Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.59,0:59:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,听说船索坏了 要修理多久？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you have difficulty with the warp drive. How long do you need for repair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.26,0:59:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,船索那有问题？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing wrong with the bloody thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.33,0:59:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,若我们回去 凶手会丢掉靴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we return to space dock,the killers can dispose of their footwear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.77,0:59:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无缘再见船长和麦盖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we will never see the Captain or Dr. McCoy alive again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.04,0:59:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,需要几星期 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could take weeks. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.61,0:59:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,通知舰队我们的船索失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Val'eris,inform Starfleet our warp drive is inoperative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.85,0:59:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谎话？只是差错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lie? An error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.38,0:59:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟船长和麦盖完全失去联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have lost all contact with the Captain and Dr. McCoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.96,0:59:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他们被磁罩包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,at the moment they're surrounded by a magnetic shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.16,0:59:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜船长一定在计划逃狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I know the Captain,he is deep into planning his escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.72,1:00:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,却克 你触怒了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got him where you want him,Jim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.21,1:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you alright? I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.48,1:01:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在受到尊重了 幸好那东西有膝盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll respect you now. I was lucky that thing had knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.78,1:01:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是他的膝盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was not his knee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.72,1:01:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人的生殖部位都不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everybody keep their genitals in the same place,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.72,1:01:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you want to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.06,1:01:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快去解释我们无意冒犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what you can do for him. Let him know we're not holding a grudge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.40,1:01:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suppose he's holding a grudge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.44,1:01:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不论人们做什么 也不要多问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When whoever it is makes their move,you won't be here to ask if he's the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.25,1:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你想逃出去吗？一定有出路的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to get out of here? There's got to be a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.87,1:02:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,退休前叁个月就完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three months before retirement. What a way to finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.44,1:02:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还未完蛋 你自圆其说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not finished. Speak for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.78,1:02:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,迟早会完的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day,one night... Kobayashi Maru!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.55,1:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕将来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones! Are you afraid of the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.19,1:02:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我一直想说的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that was the general idea that I was trying to convey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.16,1:02:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是指这个将来 是什么？选择题？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean this future. What is this multiple choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.83,1:02:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人害怕将会发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people are afraid... of what might happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.87,1:02:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我很怕你怕什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was terrified. What terrified you,specifically?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.92,1:02:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再没有中立区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more Neutral Zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.09,1:03:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我一向憎恨克林冈人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was used to hating Klingons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.19,1:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不信高冈所言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It never even occurred to me to take Gorkon at his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.00,1:03:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,史波克 对了 别自贵 我们同样难受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock was right. We all felt exactly the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.91,1:03:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 有人难受得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Somebody felt a lot worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.11,1:03:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm beginning to understand why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.92,1:03:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,若你没有好主意现在是时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you've got any bright ideas,now is the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.49,1:03:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,时间是问题 我们帮不上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is the problem. You and I are nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.22,1:03:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到吗？和谈恢复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the judge the peace conference is on again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.83,1:03:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,杀高冈的凶手会再进行暗杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever killed Gorkon is bound to attempt another assassination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.50,1:03:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我们逃离这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless we can get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.41,1:04:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 没有人曾成功逃狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me Martia. Listen. No one has ever escaped from Rura Penthe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.92,1:04:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我们 有可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except us. It is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.49,1:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道如何逃出罩外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to get outside the shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.86,1:04:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎样做？出去其实很容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we fit in? Getting outside the shield is easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.86,1:04:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但要在冻僵前逃出生天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that,you have to get us off the surface before we freeze. Can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.00,1:04:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's possible. I can't make it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.41,1:04:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最有潜质的候选人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the likeliest candidate to come here for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.61,1:04:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么候选人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candidate for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.16,1:04:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,早上采矿时在7号电梯见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to lift 7 in the morning for mining duty. I'll see you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.03,1:04:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别令我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't disappoint me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.64,1:05:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？还认为我们会完蛋吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with you,anyway? Still think we're finished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.47,1:05:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,从未如此担心过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.41,1:05:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,吵醒你真对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to wake you,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.35,1:05:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队想知道企业号的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet requests any data we have on the whereabouts of Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.06,1:05:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.69,1:05:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拒绝确认回码头的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're refusing to acknowledge signal to return to space dock,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.83,1:05:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,回覆说我们不知企业号的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signal Starfleet that we have no idea location Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.27,1:05:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,船长？你听觉有问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir? You have hearing problems?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.88,1:05:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.46,1:06:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈人的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingon blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.69,1:06:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是他们把血迹踩了进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have walked through it when it was floating and tracked it back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.86,1:06:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的第一证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the first evidence which corroborates our theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.20,1:06:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,要通知星际舰队吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we go to Starfleet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.54,1:06:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,现在连制服也要搜查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We expand our search to include uniforms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.24,1:06:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所有制服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All uniforms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.59,1:07:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear,sir. Make a hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,请让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming through. Coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.68,1:07:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,船长…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir! Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.68,1:07:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她欺骗我们 你没有被骗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've been had. No,you weren't,Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.65,1:07:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在第一层离去 跟大队到矿场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off at the first level. Follow the gang into the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.75,1:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不载女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't take girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.67,1:08:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你是迪斯？对 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are crewman Dax? Yes. What is the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.41,1:08:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,听过灰姑娘的故事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you know the Russian epic of Cinderella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.48,1:08:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,试试是否合穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If shoe fits wear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.72,1:08:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,查哥夫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Chekov...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.80,1:08:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.77,1:08:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么生物？昨晚你们… 别提了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of creature is this? Last night you two were...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.35,1:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.79,1:10:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快 我们时间无多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We don't have a lot of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.87,1:10:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.24,1:10:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.05,1:10:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来 爬上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on climb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.06,1:10:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上这些 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,you'll need these. Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.08,1:11:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.56,1:12:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这里 他们快逃出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they are. They emerge from the beaming shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.63,1:12:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,史葛 开动引擎查哥夫 驶往鲁拉宾迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Scott,start your engines. Mr Chekov,set course for Rura Penthe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.44,1:12:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁拉宾迪在克林冈边境内深处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Spock,Rura Penthe is deep inside the Klingon frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.64,1:12:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,若我们发现… 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're discovered... Correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.28,1:12:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在船长和麦盖冻死前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a feat of linguistic legerdemain and intrepidity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.92,1:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要运用掩眼法和勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the Captain and Dr. McCoy freeze to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.06,1:13:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别理我 我完了 不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me,I'm finished. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.86,1:13:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我身上有追踪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones,I'm wearing a viridium patch on my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.17,1:13:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,史波克 在我们上船前贴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock slapped it there before we went on Gorkon's ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.44,1:13:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这个狡猾的维冈人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That cunning little Vulcan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.24,1:13:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,来 我们安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! We're in the clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.45,1:13:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在罩外他们可追踪到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that we're outside the shield,they can locate us two sectors away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.25,1:13:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们在找我们的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're even looking for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.75,1:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是莫斯卡短波电台
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.79,1:14:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么船？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.87,1:14:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要回应 需要翻译\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must respond. A universal translator would be recognised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.68,1:14:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是你的货船厄斯华
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.35,1:14:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,离开了卡龙诺斯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.26,1:14:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,六星期
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.47,1:15:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们往什么目的地？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"What is your destination,over?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.48,1:15:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有食物
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.72,1:15:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,物资供应
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.06,1:15:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别捉虫子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.06,1:15:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可否解释一下你的把戏？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind explaining that little trick you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.76,1:16:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我是金密莱人 我听过这名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a Chameloid. I've heard about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.80,1:16:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,变形人 真神奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shape-shifters. I thought you were mythical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.34,1:16:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 给女孩一个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give a girl a chance,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.11,1:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很费劲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes a lot of effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.78,1:16:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't doubt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.02,1:16:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我错了 请告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop me if I'm wrong,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.79,1:16:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那一个才是真正的你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but do we have any way of knowing whether this is the real you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.59,1:16:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我采用了吸引人的形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I would assume a pleasing shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.63,1:16:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们己逃脱 到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're outside the shield. Now it's your turn,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.34,1:16:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.61,1:16:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy? !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.48,1:16:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她不需我们帮助你的便服从何来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't need our help. Where did you get these convenient clothes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.88,1:16:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那火光不是监中物件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me that flare is standard prison issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.25,1:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她在通风报信 换取报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's to let them know where we are. Ask her what she's getting in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.12,1:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然这样对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A full pardon... which doesn't cover this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.89,1:17:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能是意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An accident wasn't good enough. Come on,Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.16,1:17:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,次意外没有问题 两次会惹人怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good enough for one. Two would have looked suspicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.13,1:17:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,逃亡时被杀 双方也可信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed while attempting escape. That's convincing for both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.41,1:17:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,意外吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.92,1:17:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友来迟了 他们正赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friends are late. They'll be along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.23,1:17:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然吻过你 你一定期待己久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe I kissed you. Must have been your lifelong ambition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.08,1:17:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是时候改变形象了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it time you became something else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.48,1:17:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.03,1:18:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,well,well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.21,1:18:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何来得这么晚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.14,1:18:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他 他才是真身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him,he's the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.81,1:18:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我 是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not me,you idiot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.02,1:18:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有证人逃亡时被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No witnesses. Killed while trying to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.39,1:18:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真聪明这是经典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damned clever,if you ask me. It's a classic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.59,1:18:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们的意思 谁？谁想杀我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he wanted. Who? Who wanted us killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.73,1:18:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你要死 告诉你又何妨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you're all going to die anyway,why not tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.10,1:18:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.11,1:18:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真讨厌…你为何不多等两秒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it! What the hell! Son of a... Couldn't you have waited two seconds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.81,1:19:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他正交代事情始末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was about to explain the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.95,1:19:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你想回去？绝对不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to go back? Absolutely not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.49,1:19:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是驾驶台 我们仍在克林冈领空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the bridge. We're still in Klingon space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.19,1:19:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,9号甲板 维持战斗岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deck 9,remain at battle stations. Deck 9,remain at battle stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.96,1:19:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们被接回星盟太空船
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.53,1:19:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以追踪…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.51,1:20:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,逃脱
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.81,1:20:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,却克不知道和谈的场地
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.02,1:20:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.25,1:20:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意冒险吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.26,1:20:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,舵手 快去拦截企业号
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.63,1:20:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈人有艘猛禽号可以隐形发炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Klingons have a Bird of Prey that can fire while cloaked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.80,1:20:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,它向高冈的船发炮 就是它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She torpedoed Gorkon's ship. So that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.21,1:20:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手就在这艘船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe that Gorkon's murderers are aboard this ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.74,1:20:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,和谈开始了没有？不知道 地点保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has the peace conference begun? Who knows? The location is secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.15,1:20:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有事船长 史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's always something. Captain! Mr Spock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.35,1:20:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现染有克林冈人血迹的制服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found the uniforms with the Klingon blood on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.87,1:21:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,制服属於这两个人卜奇和沉努\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the uniforms belong to these two men. Burke and Samno.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.34,1:21:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有人近距离向他们开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore. Phaser on "stun" at close range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.25,1:21:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,暗杀规例第一条:杀死刺客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First rule of assassination kill the assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.08,1:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们退回起点了 我想和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're back to square one. Can I talk to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.36,1:21:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为何没有化掉 会惊动警钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why weren't they vaporized? It would set off the alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.97,1:21:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这也可行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.14,1:21:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now hear this. Now hear this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.17,1:21:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,速记员请到病房 蓝色急事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Court reporter to sick bay. Code blue urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.51,1:21:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,急需录取卜奇和沉努的口供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Statements to be taken at once from Yeomen Burke and Samno.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.52,1:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,速记员请到病房 蓝色急事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat,court reporter to sick bay. Code blue urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.09,1:21:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要录取口供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Statements to be taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.49,1:22:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,录取卜奇和沉努的口供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat,statements to be taken from Yeomen Burke and Samno.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.77,1:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.24,1:22:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你有逻辑的话 就应该开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are logical,you have to shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.91,1:22:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想的 你的目的毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not want to. What you want is irrelevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.92,1:23:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你的选择已经得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you've chosen is at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.25,1:23:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd just as soon you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.80,1:23:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,手术完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The operation is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.77,1:23:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有发炮 你没有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not fire. You cannot prove anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.54,1:23:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,审讯时 我的日志成为证物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I can. At my trial my personal log was used against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.85,1:23:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在我房外探听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long did you wait outside my quarters before I noticed you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.39,1:23:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.42,1:23:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我想告诉你 但你不听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to tell you,but you would not listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.03,1:23:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,当晚没有人留心听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither of us was hearing very well that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.26,1:23:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾叫你要有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were things I tried to tell you,about having faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.97,1:23:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们全部也背叛了星盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have betrayed the Federation. All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.04,1:23:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为自己在做什么 拯救星际舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what have you've been doing? Saving Starfleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.54,1:24:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈人不可靠船长 你说过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingons cannot be trusted. Sir... You said so yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.55,1:24:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们杀了你的儿子你不想高冈死吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They killed your son. Did you not wish Gorkon dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.75,1:24:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过 让他们自生自灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Let them die",you said. Did I misinterpret you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.16,1:24:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.40,1:24:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他们与我们串通暗杀自己的总理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They conspired with us to assassinate their own Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.60,1:24:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎会可信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How trustworthy can they be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.14,1:24:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈人与星盟成员串通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingons and Federation members conspiring together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.14,1:24:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是"我们"？不爱和平的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is "us"? All who stands to lose from peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.64,1:24:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说出他们的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Names,Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.41,1:24:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的同党会干扰你们的通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My comrades will make certain all your transmissions are jammed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.05,1:24:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,说出他们的名字 我记不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Names,Lieutenant! I do not remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.63,1:24:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谎话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.73,1:24:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只是选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.77,1:24:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.31,1:25:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,卡上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral Cartwright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.48,1:25:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,来自星际舰队？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Starfleet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.09,1:25:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.03,1:26:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,张上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General... Chang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.44,1:26:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还有呢？罗武伦大使及其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else? Romulan Ambassador and others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.82,1:26:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,和谈在哪里举行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the peace conference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.23,1:26:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,和谈在哪里举行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the peace conference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.46,1:27:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She does not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.57,1:27:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.71,1:27:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我己死过一次 联络上进号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been dead before. Contact Excelsior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.88,1:27:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会提供合作 我己联络了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll have the co-ordinates. I've already got it,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.15,1:27:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,却克船长 准备 苏路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standing by,Captain Kirk. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.26,1:27:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你知否我们通话是违反规条？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You realize that by even talking to us,you're violating regulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.03,1:27:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我听不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry,Captain. Your message is breaking up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.93,1:27:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,和谈在哪里举行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bless you,Sulu. Where is the peace conference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.87,1:27:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会发动第二次暗杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll attempt another assassination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.67,1:27:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,杰图马营 罗武伦边境附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's at Camp Khitomer,near the Romulan border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.88,1:27:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我会用密码信号发给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sending the co-ordinates on a coded frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.78,1:27:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕这还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.25,1:28:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被猛禽号监视它可以隐形发炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a Bird of Prey on the look-out for us that can fire while cloaked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.32,1:28:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.86,1:28:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少人在那里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of those things are there? Come on,Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.79,1:28:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只有样本你听到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the prototype. Do you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.93,1:28:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在起航 但我们郧脍一区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting under way now. We're in Alpha Quadrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.67,1:28:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕赶不及到会场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chances of our reaching the conference in time are slim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.84,1:28:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,会议何时开始？我收到的资料是今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When does this conference start? According to my information today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.31,1:28:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,Captain Sulu. Don't mention it,Captain Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.55,1:28:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,史波克 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.99,1:28:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不要开灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer it dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.00,1:28:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你在忏悔？对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dining on ashes? You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.67,1:28:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,都怪我自视过高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was arrogant presumption on my part that got us into this situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.91,1:29:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你和麦盖差点没命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and the Doctor might have been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.51,1:29:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们经验不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The night is young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.22,1:29:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你说为了和平 值得犯险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it yourself,it was logical. Peace is worth a few personal risks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.52,1:29:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你有逻辑头脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a great one for logic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.93,1:29:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我则好管闲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a great one for rushing in where angels fear to tread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.13,1:29:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们太激进 该学习中庸之道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both extremists. Reality is probably somewhere in between.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.58,1:29:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能忘掉丧子之痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't get past the death of my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.55,1:29:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她的出色表现令我偏爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was prejudiced by her accomplishments as a Vulcan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.45,1:29:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,高冈死了我才知道自己十分偏激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gorkon had to die before I understood how prejudiced I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.53,1:29:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it possible...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.07,1:30:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又老又不灵活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we two,you and I,have grown so old and inflexible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.07,1:30:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也做不来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we have outlived our usefulness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.78,1:30:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不是笑话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would that constitute a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.05,1:30:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错 我有责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't your fault. I was responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.32,1:30:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,只需为自己的行为负责 你在庭上不是这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For no actions but your own. That's not what you said at your trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.79,1:30:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,身为船长 作为人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was as captain of the ship. Human beings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.26,1:30:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你该知道我不是人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both know that I am not human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.83,1:30:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？众生也是人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to know something? Everybody's human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.30,1:30:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这句话很侮辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find that remark... insulting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.44,1:30:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来 我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come,I need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.68,1:30:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,总理小姐 各位外交人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam Chancellor,members of the diplomatic corps...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.35,1:30:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,各位来宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}honoured guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.52,1:30:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,星盟欢迎你们来到杰图马营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The United Federation of Planets welcomes you to Camp Khitomer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.91,1:31:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽号一定在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's out here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.71,1:31:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它隐了形 唯有看辐射读数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if she's cloaked... Then all we have is a radiation surge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.78,1:31:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们录得辐射时 已经炸死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time we're close enough to record it,we're ashes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.29,1:31:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,2.06…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2.06{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.96,1:31:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,2.03…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2.03{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.10,1:31:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可以起程了吗？还有两分钟 1.58\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close enough to beam down? Not yet. In two minutes. 1.58.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.97,1:31:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,全速驶往杰图马营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to impulse power for Khitomer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.68,1:31:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有能力做一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us redefine progress to mean that just because we can do a thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.19,1:32:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不代表我们一定要去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it does not necessarily follow that we must do that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.40,1:32:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,邬娜？没有异像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura? Nothing,Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.27,1:32:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽号可能正在无声航行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she's here,she's rigged for silent running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.41,1:32:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还有57秒到达运送器范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming up on transporter range in 57 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.28,1:32:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,运送器房 准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transporter room. Stand by to beam down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.09,1:32:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,53秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}53...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.09,1:32:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,48秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}48 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.97,1:32:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,44秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}44...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.14,1:32:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,却克 我看到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you,Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.81,1:32:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,张上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.01,1:32:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.68,1:32:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 战士对战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now be honest,Captain. Warrior to warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.62,1:33:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢这样的 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do prefer it this way,don't you? As it was meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.36,1:33:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这里没有和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No peace in our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.26,1:33:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好朋友 进攻又开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Once more unto the breach,dear friends."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.98,1:33:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣 回动引擎 退後\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is fun. Reverse engines. All astern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.38,1:33:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,以1.5冲力退後\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One and a half impulse power. Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.79,1:33:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.36,1:33:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,它在等什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's she waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.16,1:33:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可能想知道我们为何退後\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably attempting to ascertain why we are reversing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.13,1:33:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看我们是否侦察到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wondering whether we detect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.61,1:33:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.45,1:34:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,相通了吗？还未\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In range? Not yet,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.05,1:34:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.75,1:34:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它会爆炸的 那就炸掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll fly apart. Fly her apart,then!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.82,1:34:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人也怀疑我父亲的动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many speculated about my father's motives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.66,1:34:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有人说他是空想家有人说他没有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some said he was an idealist. Others said he had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.03,1:34:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果普拉西斯不爆炸他不会有此空想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Praxis had not exploded,his idealism wouldn't have found expression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.00,1:34:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以自己的民族为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are a proud race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.44,1:34:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想继续感到自豪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are here because we intend to go on being proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.69,1:34:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,启动後备电力 後备电路受到破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to auxiliary power! Auxiliary circuits destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.93,1:34:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,痒了可以不笑吗？刺伤了可以不流血吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Tickle us,do we not laugh? Prick us,do we not bleed?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.80,1:35:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,遭到欺负可以不报复吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Wrong us,shall we not revenge?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.64,1:35:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.88,1:35:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,船在冲力下要加气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas,Captain. Under impulse power she expands fuel,like all vessels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.85,1:35:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要离子气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call it "plasma", but it is merely ionised gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.56,1:35:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,记录气体反常的设备呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about our equipment to catalogue gaseous anomalies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.53,1:35:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定有排气管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing's got to have a tail-pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.93,1:35:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,医生 可否为飞弹做手术？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor,would you assist me in performing surgery on a torpedo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.47,1:35:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.84,1:35:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,转右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to starboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.38,1:35:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们建议在地球时间五十年内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The proposed agenda is as follows: The evacuation of Kronos{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.05,1:35:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,撤走我们的居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been calculated within the 50 Earth year time span.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.68,1:35:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,第一阶段:准备撤走…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase 1 preparation for evacuation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.43,1:36:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们受到猛击 防护罩受损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,she's packing quite a wallop. Shields weakening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.28,1:36:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,开防护罩 等待他们进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields up! Alright,now we're giving them something else to shoot at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.45,1:36:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏还未结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game's afoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.16,1:36:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,上进号被击中了 游戏结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excelsior's been hit! "Our revels now are ended", Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.44,1:36:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大混乱 我要发动战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Cry havoc,and let slip the dogs of war."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.22,1:36:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的飞弹呢 不用操心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones,where's my torpedo? Bet you wished you'd stayed in bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.56,1:37:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,防护罩塌下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields collapsing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.59,1:37:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,拿钥匙来 时间无多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key,please. Time is short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.20,1:37:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,船身被击中 不知损毁隋况如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hull has been compromised. I wonder how bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.07,1:37:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,接上回波棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connect echo-bars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.84,1:37:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,讨论第二阶段的报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}discuss the report on phase 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.41,1:37:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,更改A电路 探测器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alter circuit A. Sensor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.08,1:37:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,开始看计划的议程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we commence within minutes of the preparation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.88,1:37:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我像北极星般不败 他闭嘴的话 我给他钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I am constant as the Northern star." I'd give real money,if he'd shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.29,1:37:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拿板来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plate,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.79,1:37:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,同化要花费…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and assimilation will consume...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.63,1:37:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有反应了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a heart beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.86,1:37:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,克林冈帝国…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Klingon Empire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.93,1:37:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.87,1:37:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,飞弹呢？准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's that torpedo? She's ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.40,1:37:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,准备发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock and load!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.01,1:37:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.09,1:38:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,做还是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To be... or not"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.99,1:38:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"to be."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.09,1:38:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准它开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target that explosion and fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.57,1:38:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.11,1:38:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这项工作需时一星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This work will occupy us throughout most of the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.18,1:38:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,希望代表团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope that the delegation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.98,1:38:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,下月前履行第一阶段的规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can implement the provisions of Phase 1 by the first of next month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.26,1:38:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,时间是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know,time is of the essence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.29,1:38:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.93,1:38:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,主席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr President!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.20,1:38:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,主席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr President!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.74,1:38:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是企业号的却克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk,Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.51,1:39:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,保护总理
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.62,1:39:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,拘捕他们 拘捕你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrest those men! Arrest yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.59,1:39:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她己彻底招供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a full confession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.75,1:39:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是克林冈人的血 卡上将 别逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not Klingon blood. Cartwright. Just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.00,1:39:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事？这是怎么一回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happened? What's the mean of all of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.77,1:39:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有关未来的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about the future,Madam Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.70,1:39:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有人认为未来代表历史的终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people think the future means the end of history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.48,1:39:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但历史还未完结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't run out of history quite yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.55,1:39:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲称未来为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father called the future...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.98,1:40:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,尚未发现的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The undiscovered country".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.29,1:40:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都害怕转变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People can be very frightened of change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.06,1:40:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你重建了我父亲的信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've restored my father's faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.50,1:40:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你重建了我儿子的信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've restored my son's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.49,1:41:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再一次挽救了文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once again,we've saved civilization as we know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.45,1:41:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好他们不起诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they're not going to prosecute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.29,1:41:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我或会像韦利丽一样遭起诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They could have prosecuted me. I felt like Val'eris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.93,1:41:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't arrest people for having feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.96,1:41:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真好 否则我们会有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's a good thing,too. If they did,we'd all have to turn ourselves in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.54,1:41:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,切克船长 苏路船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk. Captain Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.88,1:41:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表所有船员向你致谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As much to the crew of the Enterprise,I owe you my thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.91,1:41:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴再次与你合作 保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to see you in action one more time,Captain Kirk. Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.96,1:41:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,天 真是艘大船 但也不及船长伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God,that's a big ship. Not so big as her captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.00,1:42:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是再见了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... This is goodbye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.91,1:42:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是时候各自启航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time we got underway ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.04,1:42:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队有令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,I have orders from Starfleet Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.35,1:42:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,马上返回太空码头 解散队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're to put back to space dock immediately... to be decommissioned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.23,1:42:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是人 我的反应会是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were human,I believe my response would be:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.97,1:42:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Go to hell."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.38,1:42:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是人的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.28,1:42:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要驶向哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Course heading,Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.53,1:42:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,右面第二个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second star to the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.36,1:42:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,直驶至明早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And straight on 'til morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.92,1:43:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,掏吕长日志 星历9529.1\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's log,stardate 9529.1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.05,1:43:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是企业号最後一次在我指挥下航行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the final cruise of the Starship Enterprise under my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.42,1:43:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这艘船和它的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship,and her history{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.63,1:43:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很快会由另一队伍接管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will shortly become the care of another crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.73,1:43:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把未来交给後世的人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To them and their posterity will we commit our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.80,1:43:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会继续我们的旅程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll continue the voyages we have begun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.40,1:43:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,探索所有尚未到过的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and journey to all the undiscovered countries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.97,1:43:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢地到没有人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}boldly going where no man,where no one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.18,1:43:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,到过的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has gone before.{\r}
